      \field{abstract}{Ensemble methods are considered the state-of-the art solution for many machine learning challenges. Such methods improve the predictive performance of a single model by training multiple models and combining their predictions. This paper introduce the concept of ensemble learning, reviews traditional, novel and state-of-the-art ensemble methods and discusses current challenges and trends in the field. This article is categorized under: Algorithmic Development > Ensemble Methods Technologies > Machine Learning Technologies > Classification}
