      \field{labelnamesource}{author}
      \field{labeltitlesource}{title}
      \field{abstract}{In the evolving landscape of machine learning research, the concept of trustworthiness receives critical consideration, both concerning data and models. However, the lack of a universally agreed upon definition of the very concept of trustworthiness presents a considerable challenge. The lack of such a definition impedes meaningful exchange and comparison of results when it comes to assessing trust. To make matters worse, coming up with a quantifiable metric is currently hardly possible. In consequence, the machine learning community cannot operationalize the term, beyond its current state as a hardly graspable concept.}
      \field{booktitle}{Explainable Artificial Intelligence}
      \field{isbn}{978-3-031-63787-2}
      \field{title}{Benchmarking Trust: A Metric for Trustworthy Machine Learning}
